    "id": 15638440575356,
    "title": "Hestia Color-Changing Foundation Stick",
    "body_html": "<p><strong>The Hestia Color-Changing Foundation Stick is the foundation that finds you.</strong> It goes on white, then adapts in seconds to your exact skin tone — no shade matching, no orange shift, no demarcation. One stick. Every undertone. Sixty seconds.</p>\n<h3>How the color-changing foundation stick works</h3>\n<p>Each stroke breaks open micro-encapsulated pigments and skin-loving ingredients. As you blend, the formula reads your undertone and matches it instantly — fair, light, natural, or medium. The result is a weightless, second-skin finish that looks like you, only better.</p>\n<h3>Why women keep coming back to Hestia</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Adapts to your skin tone in 60 seconds</strong> — no more wrong bottles, no more orange.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Built-in brush</strong> — apply, blend, and touch up on the go. No sponge, no fingers, no mess.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Korean skincare-inspired formula</strong> — niacinamide, hydrolyzed collagen, glycerin, sea buckthorn, and blueberry extract nourish while you wear it.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight, breathable coverage</strong> — sits on top of fine lines instead of sinking into them. Designed for mature and sensitive skin.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Three shades that fit most</strong> — #201 Light, #202 Natural (the safest pick), and #203 Medium.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Made for women who came back to makeup</h3>\n<p>Hestia is built for women who tried fifty foundations, gave up on shade matching, and want one product that just works. No 12-step routine. No primer, no concealer, no setting spray. One color-changing foundation stick that holds the line.</p>\n<h3>What's inside the formula</h3>\n<p><strong>Niacinamide</strong> brightens and strengthens the skin barrier. <strong>Hydrolyzed collagen</strong> keeps the complexion soft and bouncy. <strong>Glycerin and butylene glycol</strong> hold hydration all day. <strong>Sea buckthorn and blueberry extracts</strong> deliver antioxidants. Free from parabens, sulfates, fragrance, and harsh additives. Cruelty-free, dermatologist-tested.</p>\n<h3>The Hestia guarantee</h3>\n<p>Try the color-changing foundation stick for 60 days. If it doesn't match, doesn't blend, or doesn't hold — return it for a full refund. That's how confident we are.</p>",
